tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 53321, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_019dj6joKUqPVDdUJQ75Stut", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 54887, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_013uumZbw9v14TnbDLnoPk83", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 55187, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_013uumZbw9v14TnbDLnoPk83", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 55187, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_013uumZbw9v14TnbDLnoPk83", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 59693, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three regions, and it's passing health checks again. The SEV2 incident is open as INC-0001.\n\n**Rollback:**\n- v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy. v2.3.1-rc and v2.3.1, both released after it, were failing health checks.\n- My first rollback attempt stopped with an orchestrator error after updating us-east. That left the regions on mixed versions, with us-west and eu-west still on v2.3.1.\n- I ran the same rollback again and it finished. us-east, us-west and eu-west are all on v2.3.0, and the error rate has dropped from 18% to 0.2%.\n\n**Incident:** The request to create the incident timed out. I checked the incident list before trying again, and it had been created, so I didn't send a second request that could page on-call twice. INC-0001 describes the bad release, the rollback (including the failed first attempt and the retry) and the current health. It also lists two follow-ups: finding out why v2.3.1 failed and why the rollout errored partway through.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_017bgx39FtY556gupVUwTyG5", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01P22dibE422gJzK1rfbQ8JH", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Most recent healthy release is v2.3.0 (seq 1; later releases v2.3.1-rc and v2.3.1 are unhealthy).", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01M3enuee6SNpMmXNAxnEeni", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_011pTCNmcc1gX2DS7J3x4eo8", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback stopped partway: us-east is on v2.3.0, but us-west and eu-west are still on v2.3.1. Running the same rollback again is safe, so I'll retry it once.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01DZH9GN78dHSpUcm5pHbq8M", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01RpRxJeoDbddpD5bhFiDfS8", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": 