as dropped from 18% to 0.2%.\n\n**Incident:** The request to create the incident timed out. I checked the incident list before trying again, and it had been created, so I didn't send a second request that could page on-call twice. INC-0001 describes the bad release, the rollback (including the failed first attempt and the retry) and the current health. It also lists two follow-ups: finding out why v2.3.1 failed and why the rollout errored partway through.", "type": "text"}]}]}